### NRL letter-to-sound rules

`crates/klattsch-core/lts/nrl-rules.txt` is the rule table from
[mewo2/elovitz](https://github.com/mewo2/elovitz), an implementation of
Elovitz, Johnson, McHugh and Shore, *Automatic Translation of English Text to
Phonetics by Means of Letter-to-Sound Rules* (NRL Report 7948, 1976).

